## 2. Branching and Versioning Strategy

### 2.1 Branching
- Branches will continue to be cut and maintained per release as per the current process.

### 2.2 Versioning
- For **breaking changes** in any service, create a new YAML file in the `helmcharts` repo with an incremental version.
- **Example**:  
  - **Unversioned service**: `login.yaml`
  - **Versioned service**: `login-v1.yaml`

### 2.3 Dev Team Responsibility
- Ensure the correct service version points to the correct YAML file by:
  - Changing the service name in the `Jenkinsfile` and `.env` file to match the YAML file name.
  - Referencing the `login service poc-v1 branch` for guidance.

### 2.4 URL Changes with Versioning
- **Unversioned Service URL**:  
  `https://dev1.mbrw.com/login/setMpin`
- **Versioned Service URL**:  
  `https://dev1.mbrw.com/login-v1/setMpin`

**Note**: The service version will not be a part of the URL path but will be embedded in the service name itself.

